usqr-f: x * x, for x from 0 to 31.
Cells 56-98. To call it, load x into the accumulator and JMP 56.
It returns x * x in the accumulator.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99.
Size 43 cells. It runs at most 9 instructions, 9.0 on average, counted from cell 56 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain; outside it, x reads past the table.

cell  contents   notes
 56     663      STO 63   cells 56-58: the call: store x, and copy the return jump from cell 99 into cell 98
 57     199      CLA 99
 58     698      STO 98
 59     163      CLA 63   cells 59-62: build CLA 65 + x in cell 97 and jump to it
